rd mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，务必单独处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_c \\le 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的相机背后情形。</li>\n<li>直线方向会把玩家领到墙边，进阶导航调用导航网格寻路，标记沿可走路径的拐点；用分层更新频率平衡开销。</li>\n<li>2026 年「关闭标记以换沉浸」成为鲜明趋势，面包屑引导用环境线索替代硬箭头。</li>\n<li>正确做法是把导航强度做成可配置谱系，兼顾沉浸玩家与无障碍需求，而非全局二选一。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>追踪哪个目标（pinned）由谁决定：<a href=\"quest-log\">任务日志</a></li>\n<li>目标的位置元数据存在哪：<a href=\"../foundations/quest-data-model\">任务数据模型</a></li>\n<li>相机背后翻转、路径指向旧位置等错位成因：<a href=\"../practice/quest-pitfalls\">陷阱与边界</a></li>\n<li>可走路径怎么算出来：<a href=\"../../pathfinding-navigation-mesh/\">寻路与导航网格</a></li>\n<li>导航为何必须可配置：<a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/advanced-inclusive/accessibility\">游戏 UI/UX · 无障碍</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.ingamenews.com/2026/05/why-exploration-without-map-markers.html\">Why Exploration Without Map Markers Defines 2026 Gaming Trends（ingamenews，2026-05）</a>、<a href=\"https://www.gameuidatabase.com/index.php?scrn=163\">Game UI Database — Waypoints and Markers</a></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"世界标记与导航","id":"世界标记与导航"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从目标到世界坐标","id":"核心概念-从目标到世界坐标"},{"level":2,"text":"标记类型与屏幕空间投影","id":"标记类型与屏幕空间投影"},{"level":2,"text":"导航：从直线指引到可走路径","id":"导航-从直线指引到可走路径"},{"level":2,"text":"显示还是隐藏：2026 的导航哲学之争","id":"显示还是隐藏-2026-的导航哲学之争"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"任务日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-quest-objective-systems/tracking/quest-log"},"next":{"title":"任务持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-quest-objective-systems/practice/quest-persistence"}}